# 📝 TOEIC Part 5 - Day36

## Question 1

The new system is _____ than the old one.

A. efficient
B. more efficient
C. most efficient
D. the most efficient

Answer: B

→ 두 시스템 비교
→ 비교급

---

## Question 2

This is _____ product in our store.

A. popular
B. more popular
C. the most popular
D. most popular

Answer: C

→ 최상급
→ the most popular

---

## Question 3

The company's revenue is _____ higher than last year.

A. much
B. many
C. most
D. more

Answer: A

→ much + 비교급

much higher

---

## Question 4

This model is _____ than the previous version.

A. better
B. best
C. good
D. the better

Answer: A

→ good의 비교급 = better

---

## Challenge

The _____ employees become, the more productive the company becomes.

A. efficient
B. more efficient
C. most efficient
D. efficiently

Answer: B

→ The + 비교급, the + 비교급

The more efficient employees become...

---

## Key Point

### 비교급

A + be + 비교급 + than + B

### 최상급

the + 최상급

### 비교급 강조

much / far / even + 비교급

### 점점 더

비교급 + and + 비교급

### ~할수록

The + 비교급, the + 비교급
